✈️ Flight Price Prediction MLOps Platform

An end-to-end MLOps project that predicts flight prices using Machine Learning while demonstrating modern MLOps practices including experiment tracking, workflow orchestration, containerization, CI/CD, and Kubernetes deployment.

🚀 Project Overview

This project was built to simulate a real-world machine learning production system rather than just a notebook-based model.

The platform:

Performs exploratory data analysis on travel datasets
Trains and evaluates machine learning models
Tracks experiments using MLflow
Serves predictions through a Flask REST API
Provides a user-friendly frontend interface
Automates retraining workflows using Apache Airflow
Containerizes applications using Docker
Deploys services on Kubernetes (Minikube)
Implements CI/CD using Jenkins

The objective is to demonstrate the complete machine learning lifecycle from data ingestion to scalable deployment.

